01:21:03.360 --> 01:21:04.320
Everything's falling fast.

01:21:05.820 --> 01:21:07.200
Can't trust nobody. None of them.

01:22:00.670 --> 01:22:02.240
You can't get away, Brown.

01:22:53.160 --> 01:22:54.240
jail, Mr. Brown.

01:22:54.620 --> 01:22:56.730
You're not taking me to jail. You'll have to kill me first.

01:22:57.260 --> 01:22:59.370
Go ahead, shoot. Go ahead, kill me, copper. Kill me.

01:22:59.700 --> 01:23:00.000
Go ahead.

01:23:00.920 --> 01:23:05.990
Let's go, hoodlum.
